  entryDialogues:
  - Good evening. I have clearance for a short research stay. I trust everything
    is in order.
  - "Hello. I\u2019ll be staying briefly\u2014academic work. I\u2019ve brought all
    required documents."
  - Ah, yes. Apologies for the hour. Travel delays. I assume this will only take
    a moment.
  anomalyEntryDialogues:
  - "Good evening. I\u2019ve been here before\u2026 haven\u2019t I? \u2026No, that\u2019s
    not right. My mistake."
  - "Hello. I\u2019m here for research. \u2026Strange. I don\u2019t remember what
    field."
  - "Ah, yes. My documents. Everything should be correct. I checked them earlier.
    Or\u2026 I will check them."
